{% extends "./layout.njk" %}
{% block headStylesheets %}
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="/homepage.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/homepage.css">
{% endblock %}
{% set activeNav = 1 %}

{% block content %}

<div class="top-text-wrapper">
    <h1 class="font-black top-text-title">Hi! I'm Alex</h1>
    <div class="top-text-body">
        I'm a <strong>Motion Designer, Illustrator</strong>
        and <strong>Interactive Animator</strong> who loves making things move,<br />
        play and come to life.
    </div>
    <div class="top-text-body">
        I work with brands, studios and creative teams to make all sorts of things, from playful<br />
        animations and motion graphics to interactive experiences and everything in between. I enjoy<br />
        experimenting with movement, interaction and ideas, and adding a little bit of personality and<br />
        fun to whatever I'm working on!
    </div>
    <div class="top-text-body">
        Basically, I like making things that people want to look at, play with and come back to.
    </div>
</div>
<div class="showreel-wrapper">
    <a href="/reel">
        <iframe async aria-label="showreel" title="showreel"
            src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1177084592?autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&title=0&sidedock=0&controls=0&app_id=58479"
            frameborder="0" allow="autoplay" class="showreel-video" defer></iframe>
    </a>
</div>
<svg viewBox="0 0 600 30" class="showreel-drip">
    <path d="M0,20 C100,20 200,0 300,10 C350,15 500,30 600,10  L600,00 L0,00 Z"></path>
</svg>

<h1 class="featured-title font-black">MY FEATURED WORK</h1>

<div class="featured-wrapper">
    <div class="featured-responsive-text" style="order: 1; background-color: #AB1447">
        <h1 style="color: #F8EFE3">Phantom Pops</h1>
        <h2 style="color: #F8EFE3">Interactive characters & Social Media Posts</h2>
        <p style="color: #F8EFE3">
            As part of a collaboration project, I created three
            brand animations for the concept brand Phantom
            Pops. Exploring Interactive Animation in Rive, and
            crafting a retro promo ad and social media assets in
            After Effects, my motion design wizardry helped
            breath a new layer of life into an exciting brand.
        </p>
    </div>
