        <h1 style="color: #1A1A1A">Carlis Story</h1>
        <h2 style="color: #1A1A1A">Charity Explainer</h2>
        <p style="color: #1A1A1A">
            I was entusted by the charity Homeless Oxfordshire
            to tell Carli's real story. Given the tough and
            personal nature of the story I knew I would be
            dealing with, I wanted to use a style that captures
            the reality of life and its imperfections. This intention
            led me to chose a hand drawn style and to use
            Carlis actual voice as narration.
        </p>
